Installed axios, ws, technicalindicators, ccxt, express, cors, dotenv, node-cron, lodash, --save-dev nodemon
ccxt → Exchange API integration (the backbone).

express → API backend for your tool.

cors → Makes frontend ↔ backend communication possible.

dotenv → Keeps API keys safe.

node-cron → Automates recurring tasks (funding, OI tracking).

lodash → Makes handling data easier and faster.
Core data feed: ws (direct exchange sockets).

User dashboards: socket.io (push signals to multiple clients).

Market intelligence: cheerio (scrape extra info from non-API sources).

Sentiment edge: sentiment or node-nlp (analyze trader mood/news).